 "remarks": "Discover the exceptional appeal of Chesterfield, Stamford's most desirable gated condominium community, offering an outstanding blend of comfort, convenience, and resort-style amenities. This sun-filled corner-unit residence offers a special combination of privacy, charm, and two private decks; one extending from the living room and the other from the dining room-creating wonderful opportunities to relax, entertain, and enjoy your own outdoor retreat. The spacious, inviting living room is enhanced by a cozy fireplace, creating the perfect setting for relaxing evenings. The eat-in kitchen offers a welcoming space for casual dining, while beautiful hardwood floors lend warmth and timeless elegance to the home. The generously appointed bedroom features three closets, providing exceptional storage, and the convenience of second-floor laundry makes everyday living effortless. Chesterfield's amenities elevate the lifestyle even further, with two swimming pools and the added benefit of parking for two cars. Ideally situated near local shopping, dining, and public transportation, this inviting residence offers the perfect balance of comfortable living, private outdoor enjoyment, and everyday convenience.",
